Package: descriptR
Type: Package
Title: Comprehensive Descriptive Statistics with Automated Insights
Version: 0.1.0
Date: 2025-12-31
Authors@R: c(
    person("Abdul", "Ali",
           email = "dr.abdulali@example.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"),
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0000-0000-0000"))
    )
Description: A unified, intelligent R package for descriptive and inferential
    statistics that automatically detects variable types and applies appropriate
    analyses. Generates narrative insights from data and produces publication-ready
    outputs in multiple formats (HTML, Word, Excel, PDF). Handles missing data
    intelligently, supports grouped comparisons with effect sizes, and integrates
    seamlessly with tidyverse workflows. Features advanced color schemes and
    multi-resolution export capabilities for publications, presentations, and
    social media.
